@scenario tutorial_topics
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[if !tutorial_count]
[set tutorial_count 0]
[endif]
[show ginger beside_code normal]
# region welcome
ginger: Hello, welcome to the JVN tutorial! I'm Ginger. I'll show you how to turn a few lines of script into a playable visual novel.
# endregion
[set tutorial_source scripts/story/tutorial_hub.vns]
[set tutorial_excerpt welcome]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: That's the line you just read. Open this script in the Editor and try changing my greeting. Next you’ll see the topic tree. Drag it to explore, or select a lesson to try it.
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
@label topics
[hide ginger]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Writing and branching -> topics_page_1
> Characters and backgrounds -> topics_page_2
> Animation, audio and lighting -> topics_page_3
> Text and interfaces -> topics_page_4
> Game systems -> topics_page_5
> Testing and editor tools -> topics_page_6
> Authoring workshop -> topics_page_7
> UI, gameplay and release labs -> topics_page_8
> Interactive worlds -> topics_page_9
> Reusable systems -> topics_page_10
> Progress and motion -> options
> Return to title -> goodbye
@label goodbye
[mainmenu story/tutorial_hub.vns]
[end]
@label options
narrator: Completed lessons: {b}${tutorial_count} / 52{/b}.
> Use reduced motion -> still
> Enable movement -> motion
> All topics -> topics
@label still
[flag tutorial_still]
[set ui.reduceMotion true]
[jump topics]
@label motion
[set tutorial_still false]
[set ui.reduceMotion false]
[jump topics]
@label topics_page_1
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Dialogue -> open_dialogue
> Pauses and timing -> open_narration
> Variables and conditions -> open_variables
> Choices and labels -> open_menus
> Subroutines -> open_subroutines
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_2
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Expressions -> open_expressions
> Backgrounds -> open_images
> Transitions -> open_transitions
> Character movement -> open_movement
> Camera movement -> open_camera
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_3
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Sound effects -> open_audio
> Puppeteer timelines -> open_puppeteer
> Sprite effects -> open_plugins_and_line_boil
> Particles -> open_particles_and_visualizers
> Stage lighting -> open_layer_groups_and_lighting
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_4
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Localization -> open_localization
> Dialogue layout -> open_ui_layout
> Dialogue and narration -> open_dialogue_presentation
> Reactive UI -> open_reactive_ui_and_facets
> Phone messages -> open_phone_storytelling
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_5
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Opening a JES scene -> open_vns_jes
> Saving and rollback -> open_saves_rollback_persistence
> Editing JES entities -> open_jes_entities_input_widgets
> Collision shapes -> open_jes_worlds_physics_rpg
> Combining systems -> open_java_extensions_and_capstone
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_6
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Debugging a scene -> open_best_practices
> Testing a build -> open_testing_release
> Previewing an edit -> open_editor_workflows
> Rendering performance -> open_assets_and_performance
> Reduced motion -> open_accessibility_and_controls
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_7
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Conditional choices -> open_gated_choices
> Named display slots -> open_display_slots
> Inline text styles -> open_text_styles
> Persistent profile state -> open_profile_state
> Shared script declarations -> open_shared_declarations
> Audio channels and mixing -> open_audio_channels
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_8
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Modal panels and results -> open_facet_return_values
> Choice maps and navigation -> open_topic_map
> JES buttons and sliders -> open_jes_widgets
> JES cameras and parallax -> open_jes_camera
> History and UI contrast -> open_history_contrast
> Package and smoke test -> open_release_smoke_check
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_9
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> Tilemaps and collision -> open_tilemap_world
> Physics and restitution -> open_physics_lab
> AI steering and pathfinding -> open_ai_lab
> JES keyboard actions -> open_jes_input
> Tile triggers -> open_tile_triggers
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_10
[hide ginger]
[bg room]
[set ui.topicMap config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
> RPG items and stats -> open_inventory_lab
> Plural and number formatting -> open_plural_format
> Layer groups and pivot points -> open_group_pivots
> JES results in VNS -> open_jes_return
> Parallel JES timelines -> open_parallel_timeline
> All topics -> topics
